    <item>
      <title>谷歌AI“Plus”全球大撒网：会员制AI，你“冲”不“冲”？</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/aiplusai-20251008031004834-0/</link>
      <pubDate>Wed, 08 Oct 2025 03:10:04 +0800</pubDate>
